Author: Rubesh [aut, cre], Think Denominator [cph]
Maintainer: Rubesh <rubesh@thinkdenominator.com>
Description: Creates publication-ready rank transition charts showing how
    categories move between ordered states. Top-ranked categories are displayed
    together with entrants to and exits from the selected top ranks.
